      "writtenOn": "2022-11-01T15:52:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I did some digging in the current code and I can\u0027t actually find any differences. It may be that Ganesh has some special handling, but graphite does not any more (and maybe never did, or it\u0027s been made consistent in the recent refactorings to UniformManager).\n\nOne thing I did notice was that the `RulesMetal` struct/template is identical to the `Rules430` struct. Perhaps we don\u0027t even need a `kMetal` in the Layout enum any more?\n\nRegardless of that decision, I withdraw my thinking that the comment has value. It\u0027s 100% stale at this point and should be removed like John suggested.",
